            "review_text": "icelatte13\nSingapore, Singapore39 contributions\n0\nGood Lunch\nAug 2016 • Friends\nWe came here for a late lunch and were surprised by the nice food that served at this restaurant. We reached here a little after 2.30pm and were surprised they are able to serve lunch. \nWe ordered a mix of local vietnamese dishes, pizza and pasta. The pizza and pasta were so good that we ordered again. We also enjoyed the simple Soup Noodle with Chicken, which is one of the local vietnamese food.\nThe prices were also reasonable for 6 of us, and the staff were friendly. Recommended if you need a decent environment and good food.\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten September 5, 2016",
            "rating": 5.0,
