            "review_title": "Review at Cicilia Restaurant",
            "review_text": "bibouche2000\n4 contributions\n0\nTerrible...\nOct 2015 • Couples\nWe stayed in Cicilia Hotel (loved the room, but a bit overpriced). We were hungry and wanted to have dinner.... what a mistake!\nThe entrance of the restaurant is located in the lobby area. During Dinner time, some staff (obviously an outside contractor) was repairing the entrance of the restaurant. These gentlemen were dirty and smelly, talking very loud...\nThe renovation were making quite some noise and the smell from the products was horrible.\nwe had to by pass carefully the workers to get to the restaurant.\nThere was only a single waitress present and she couldn't answer our questions about the menu...\nWe had a smoothie and decided to go dinner somewhere else....\n\nThis place has great potential... but is poorly managed...\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 21, 2016",
